  _name: Suppression
  _description: A 6-second "Suppression" debuff is applied to the opponent, if the
    opponent starts moving, he begins to lose 1% of the current mana reserve for
    each meter passed.   "The curse of the dark huntress, full of pain and hatred
    for her enemies, will break the will of even the strongest in spirit."
